  <diagram id="4.6-责任链短路与人群位图与六边形架构" name="4.6-责任链短路与人群位图与六边形架构">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1100" dy="700" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2400" pageHeight="2600" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
<mxCell id="0"/>
<mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
<mxCell id="na" value="&lt;b&gt;A. 责任链 BusinessLinkedList：短路执行&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;框架在 types：自实现双向链表，apply() 从头遍历&lt;br&gt;对每个 handler 执行 apply，遇到第一个非 null 返回就&quot;短路&quot;停下" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;fontColor=#666666;fontSize=13;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="30.0" width="980" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="nreq" value="&lt;b&gt;请求(命令实体)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;TradeLockRuleCommandEntity /&lt;br&gt;TradeSettlementRuleCommandEntity" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontColor=#1e1e1e;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="205.0" width="220" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="nh1" value="&lt;b&gt;H1 规则过滤&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;lock链: ActivityUsabilityRuleFilter&lt;br&gt;活动生效/时间窗&lt;br&gt;settle链: SCRuleFilter 渠道黑名单" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontColor=#1e1e1e;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="460.0" y="205.0" width="340" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="nh2" value="&lt;b&gt;H2 规则过滤&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;lock链: UserTakeLimitRuleFilter&lt;br&gt;限参团次数&lt;br&gt;settle链: OutTradeNoRuleFilter 单存在" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontColor=#1e1e1e;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="890.0" y="205.0" width="340" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="nh3" value="&lt;b&gt;H3 规则过滤&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;settle链: SettableRuleFilter&lt;br&gt;支付时间在团有效期内&lt;br&gt;settle链: EndRuleFilter 防腐回传" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontColor=#1e1e1e;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1320.0" y="205.0" width="340" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="nstop" value="&lt;b&gt;任一返回非 null 即停&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;结果 = 该 handler 的返回值&lt;br&gt;(业务异常直接抛出终止)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#a61b1b;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="460.0" y="380.0" width="330" height="74" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="nallnull" value="&lt;b&gt;全部 null → 走完全链&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;约定&quot;规则全过时返回空&quot;，主流程继续" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontColor=#1e1e1e;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1320.0" y="380.0" width="260" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="nb" value="&lt;b&gt;B. Redis RBitSet 人群标签（O(1) 判定）&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;人群众多 → 用位图：某 tagId 一个 RBitSet，1 bit = 1 个用户" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;fontColor=#666666;fontSize=13;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="730.0" width="980" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="nw" value="&lt;b&gt;写入人群&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;TagRepository.addCrowTagsUserId&lt;br&gt;userCrowdTag(tagId).set(index, true)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;verticalAlign=top;labelPosition=center;align=center;spacingTop=-6;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontColor=#1e1e1e;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="905.0" width="340" height="74" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="nidx" value="&lt;b&gt;userId → 位下标&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;getIndexFromUserId(userId)&lt;br&gt;MD5(userId) → 哈希取模 → 正整数下标&lt;br&gt;(i.e. 用户映射到 bit 位)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontColor=#1e1e1e;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="460.0" y="905.0" width="340" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="nbs" value="&lt;b&gt;Redis 位图&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;RBitSet(tagId)&lt;br&gt;SETBIT index=1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;verticalAlign=top;labelPosition=center;align=center;spacingTop=-6;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#1e1e1e;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="890.0" y="905.0" width="300" height="74" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="nread" value="&lt;b&gt;三处读同一 isTagCrowRange&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;① TagNode：命中才 visible/enable&lt;br&gt;② 折扣TAG：不在人群→原价返回&lt;br&gt;③ 活动 tagScope 报名限制&lt;br&gt;ActivityRepository.isTagCrowRange → GETBIT" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontColor=#1e1e1e;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="1080.0" width="340" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="nwarn" value="&lt;b&gt;⚠ 位图取舍：碰撞误判&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;MD5取模有碰撞 → 偶发把非目标用户误判进人群，且不可逆；&lt;br&gt;适合&quot;容忍少量误差&quot;的大规模圈选；&lt;br&gt;精确判定场景应改用 Redis Set/精确索引。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#a61b1b;fontSize=11;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="1255.0" width="400" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="nc" value="&lt;b&gt;C. 六边形 / 端口-适配器（依赖都指向 domain）&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;domain 只声明两个口：ITradeRepository(进) / ITradePort(出)&lt;br&gt;infrastructure 各自实现，换存储/换通知通道不动核心业务" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;fontColor=#666666;fontSize=13;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="1605.0" width="980" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="nctrl" value="&lt;b&gt;trigger 层(HTTP入口)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;MarketTradeController&lt;br&gt;lock-market-pay-order /&lt;br&gt;settlement_market_pay_order" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#1e1e1e;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="1780.0" width="300" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="nsvc" value="&lt;b&gt;domain 领域服务(纯业务)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;TradeLockOrderService&lt;br&gt;TradeSettlementOrderService&lt;br&gt;只依赖接口，不 import OkHttp/Redisson" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontColor=#1e1e1e;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="460.0" y="1780.0" width="340" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="nrepo" value="&lt;b&gt;infrastructure 入站实现&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;TradeRepository&lt;br&gt;组合 DAO(MyBatis) + DCCService + IRedisService" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;verticalAlign=top;labelPosition=center;align=center;spacingTop=-6;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontColor=#1e1e1e;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="1955.0" width="340" height="74" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="nport" value="&lt;b&gt;infrastructure 出站实现&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;TradePort → 先抢 RLock →&lt;br&gt;gateway/GroupBuyNotifyService(OkHttp)&lt;br&gt;回调第三方商城(测试可用 TestApiClientController)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#1e1e1e;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="890.0" y="1955.0" width="300" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="next" value="&lt;b&gt;外部系统(第三方收方)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;接收成团回调，返回 success/error" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontColor=#1e1e1e;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="890.0" y="2130.0" width="220" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e0" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;exitX=0.5;exitY=1.0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="nreq" target="nh1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;exitX=0.5;exitY=1.0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="nh1" target="nh2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;exitX=0.5;exitY=1.0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="nh2" target="nh3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e3" value="被拦截" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#b85450;exitX=1.0;exitY=0.5;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="nh1" target="nstop"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e4" value="放行" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;exitX=0.5;exitY=1.0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="nh3" target="nallnull"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;exitX=0.5;exitY=1.0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="nw" target="nidx"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e6" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;exitX=0.5;exitY=1.0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="nidx" target="nbs"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e7" value="SETBIT 后供 GETBIT 判定" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;exitX=1.0;exitY=0.5;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="nbs" target="nread"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e8" value="HTTP" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;exitX=0.5;exitY=1.0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="nctrl" target="nsvc"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e9" value="ITradeRepository" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontColor=#9673a6;exitX=0.5;exitY=1.0;entryX=0.0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="nsvc" target="nrepo"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e10" value="ITradePort" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#d79b00;exitX=0.5;exitY=1.0;entryX=0.0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="nsvc" target="nport"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e11" value="HTTP POST" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;exitX=0.5;exitY=1.0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="nport" target="next"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
